{"id":"n67838-1-19","stage":1,"title":"온도 · 温度","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67838-1-19-1","ko":"여름인데 방이 왜 이렇게 춥니?","zh":"现在是夏天，房间怎么这么冷啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여름인데","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름인데","audio":"/audio/5e7ba5b775a99e668843.mp3"}},{"text":"방이","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방이","audio":"/audio/f8b8dcbdcf795ca5e772.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"춥니?","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"춥니","audio":"/audio/5138e5cd319bc218b7bb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ccdc5674e15f404d40c1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67838-1-19-2","ko":"더워서 에어컨을 좀 오래 틀었더니 온도가 너무 많이 내려갔어.","zh":"因为太热了，所以开了很久的空调，温度降得太低了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"더워서","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더워서","audio":"/audio/4fc1026c1fcc769f3258.mp3"}},{"text":"에어컨을","meaning":"空调","explanation":"에어컨：空调；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"에어컨","audio":"/audio/4641fbad3b128eddb044.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62514","senseId":"1","lemma":"에어컨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"에어컨을","audio":"/audio/cc0926b5dbec3323fdef.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"오래","meaning":"好久，很久","explanation":"오래：好久，很久。","readings":[{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57308","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surf